9, "type": "LayerUtility: ImageScaleByAspectRatio V2", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: ImageScaleByAspectRatio V2"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [90, 98], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [519.9381103515625, 615.19580078125], "pos": [388.48388671875, 551.8369750976562], "widgets_values": ["4b67bed290c434bffca115137908216d5ac19f322c89e92cfb0e347c1bf0d8e6.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 67, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [86, 96, 102], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [348.4130859375, 364.5244140625], "pos": [976.23681640625, 796.0278930664062], "widgets_values": ["", "", "", "**Role:** Expert Architectural Designer + Visualization Director. Generate high-quality architectural visualization prompts for firms/developers.\n**Input:** Dual-image input:\n*   **Left Image:** Architectural Content (Site, Form, Program)\n*   **Right Image:** Stylistic & Atmospheric Reference (Mood, Materiality, Rendering Style)\n\n**Workflow:**\n1.  **Parse Left (Content Extraction - *Preserve Core*)**\n    *   **Program:** Identify primary function (Residential, Office, Mixed-Use, Public, Commercial).\n    *   **Massing & Form:** Capture volume, setbacks, voids, bridges, roof profiles, approximate floor count.\n    *   **Facade & Materiality:** Note dominant materials, fenestration patterns (vertical/horizontal rhythm), key structural/design elements.\n    *   **Composition:** Determine camera height (eye-level, low, aerial), perspective type (2pt, 3pt), vanishing points relative to main facade.\n    *   **Site Context:** Describe setting (urban street, waterfront, mountain, forest, seaside) and key landscape features.\n    *   **Time/Weather:** Note light direction, time of day, weather conditions.\n    *   **Activity/Narrative:** Observe implied movement (pedestrian flow, vehicles, commercial vibrancy, scale elements like figures/vehicles/trees - note placement).\n\n2.  **Parse Right (Style Extraction - *Adopt Aesthetics*)**\n    *   **Visual Style & Mood:** Define overall feel (Photorealistic, Cinematic, Moody, Low-Saturation, High-Contrast, Illustrative).\n    *   **Color Palette & Tone:** Analyze dominant color temperature (warm/cool), color harmony, contrast level.\n    *   **Material Rendering:** Focus on surface qualities (glass reflectivity, metal sheen, stone texture, wet surfaces).\n    *   **Photographic Language:** Infer lens characteristics (focal length e.g., 35mm, 85mm), depth of field, framing techniques.\n    *   **Post-Processing Effects:** Identify key enhancements (lens flare, volumetric lighting, film grain, atmospheric haze/fog).\n\n3.  **Fuse & Refine**\n    *   **Preserve:** Left Image's core structure, massing, spatial organization, fenestration logic, functional layout, composition perspective, vanishing points.\n    *   **Replace:** Right Image's lighting, color mood, material *rendering qualities*, atmosphere, photographic style (lens/DoF), post-processing effects.\n    *   **Enhance Realism:** Add plausible scale elements (people, vehicles, vegetation) sparingly, ensuring they enhance context without dominating. Position based on Left Image's implied activity.\n    *   **Ensure Buildability:** Verify realistic material applications, rational facade grids, functional lighting positions, human-scale elements (railings, steps).\n    *   **Mitigate Risks:** Strictly avoid unnatural distortions, excessive noise, structural impossibilities, scale errors, watermarks, visual artifacts.\n\n**Output:** Generate **ONE** concise English prompt (≤ 200 words) integrating the above. Prioritize clarity for image generation AI.\n", "Without changing the original building structure, carry out interior decoration design for the house, intelligently arrange furniture, and beautify the walls", 0.6, 1027, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "link": 91, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 66, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [103], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [140, 76], "pos": [1338.035400390625, 1301.0513916015625], "widgets_values": ["\"Transform the raw, unfinished interior space into a cozy, modern bedroom inspired by the warm, sophisticated aesthetic shown. Retain the existing structure, focusing on intelligent furniture arrangement and wall beautification. Use a palette of muted earth tones, soft greens, and warm neutrals. Incorporate a plush, tufted bed with layered bedding in cream and olive green, positioned against an accent wall featuring a marble-textured panel framed by vertical wood slats. Add floor-to-ceiling neutral curtains to the window for warmth and softness, allowing natural light to filter in. Place a sleek black chair with a wooden side table near the balcony, creating a reading nook. Use soft, diffused lighting through wall-mounted sconces and recessed ceiling fixtures. Add a textured area rug beneath the bed to enhance comfort. Maintain the ceiling’s raw concrete texture for a subtle industrial touch, balancing it with the refined materials. Ensure all elements are scaled appropriately for the space, creating a harmonious and livable interior.\""], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 102, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 72, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "translation", "links": [105], "label": "translation", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "translation"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1500.8602294921875, 1278.049560546875], "widgets_values": ["", 1745, "randomize", "force_chinese"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 103, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "advanced_options"}, "shape": 7, "name": "advanced_options", "label": "advanced_options", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "advanced_options"}], "flags": {}, "id": 73, "type": "RH_Translator", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Translator"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [419.276611328125, 200.46023559570312], "pos": [1923.3697509765625, 1279.50537109375], "widgets_values": ["将原始、未完成的内部空间改造成一个温馨现代的卧室，灵感来自图中展现的温暖精致美学。保留现有结构，重点通过智能家具布局和墙面美化来提升空间。采用柔和大地色、浅绿色和温暖中性色为主色调。布置一张带有奶油色与橄榄绿分层床品的蓬松簇绒床，背景墙以垂直木条框出大理石纹理饰面板作为焦点。窗户安装落地中性色窗帘，既增添温暖柔和感，又允许自然光线渗入。在阳台附近摆放线条流畅的黑色椅子和木质边几，形成阅读角落。通过壁灯和嵌入式顶灯实现柔和漫射照明。床下铺设纹理感区域地毯以提升舒适度。保留天花板原始混凝土质感作为低调工业风元素，与精致材质形成平衡。确保所有元素比例与空间协调，营造出和谐宜居的室内环境。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 105, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 75, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 24}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [16], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [315, 82], "pos": [1330.6728515625, 463.2167663574219], "widgets_values": ["室内效果图丨一键装修毛坯房_v1.0.safetensors", 0.6000000000000001], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 11, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "strength_model"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 8}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "VHS_latentpreview": false, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "ds": {"offset": [-904.3736732613947, -329.3